[2026-03-14T21:39:47.323Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UVzJXLZVfzTSr5V3jy3JqB","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have a complete understanding. Let me create a comprehensive report for you.\n\n## AirbnbClone App - Main Page Analysis\n\n### Main Page Data Structure\n\nThe main page (Home component at `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/Home.tsx`) displays the following:\n\n**Data Displayed:**\n- **Property Cards Grid**: A responsive grid of property listings (1-4 columns depending on screen size)\n- **Each Property Card Contains:**\n  - Property image with hover zoom effect\n  - Property type badge (top-left, e.g., \"Apartment\", \"House\", \"Villa\")\n  - Property title\n  - Location (city, country)\n  - Price per night\n  - Star rating with review count (if reviews exist) or \"New\" label (if no reviews)\n  - Favorite button (heart icon that toggles when logged in)\n\n### Page Element Selectors\n\n**Search Bar** (`data-testid=\"search-bar\"`):\n- Location input: `data-testid=\"search-location\"` - placeholder \"Where are you going?\"\n- Check-in date: `data-testid=\"search-checkin\"`\n- Check-out date: `data-testid=\"search-checkout\"`\n- Guests input: `data-testid=\"search-guests\"` - placeholder \"Guests\"\n- Search button: `data-testid=\"search-button\"`\n\n**Category Filter** (`data-testid=\"category-filter\"`):\n- Individual type chips: `data-testid=\"category-chip-{type}\"` where type is one of:\n  - Apartment, House, Cabin, Villa, Condo, Loft, Cottage, Townhouse\n- Example: `data-testid=\"category-chip-Apartment\"`\n\n**Property Grid** (`data-testid=\"property-grid\"`):\n- Grid container with loading state: `data-testid=\"property-grid-loading\"`\n- Empty state: `data-testid=\"property-grid-empty\"`\n\n**Property Cards**:\n- Card container: `data-testid=\"property-card-{propertyId}\"`\n- Property type badge: `data-testid=\"property-type-badge-{propertyId}\"`\n- Property title text (within card)\n- Location text: \"{city}, {country}\"\n- Price text: \"${price} / night\"\n- Rating text: \"{rating.toFixed(1)} ({reviewCount})\" or \"New\"\n\n### Write Operations Available\n\n**Primary Write Operation: Add/Remove Favorite**\n\nThis is the most accessible write operation on the home page without navigation:\n\n**Favorite Button** (`data-testid=\"favorite-button-{propertyId}\"`):\n- Located in top-right corner of each property card image\n- Button class: `rounded-full bg-white/70 hover:bg-white/90 transition-colors`\n- Heart icon changes fill color:\n  - Unfilled (gray text): Not favorited\n  - Filled (primary color): Favorited\n- Requires user to be logged in (FavoriteButton returns null if not authenticated)\n- Dispatches Redux action: `addFavorite()` or `removeFavorite()`\n- Action payload: `{ userId: currentUser.id, propertyId }`\n\n**How to Test Favorite in Playwright:**\n1. User must be logged in (have `currentUser` in auth state)\n2. Find favorite button: `page.getByTestId('favorite-button-{propertyId}')`\n3. Click to toggle favorite state\n4. Verify heart icon class changes between filled/unfilled\n5. Verify Redux state updates `favorites.propertyIds` array\n\n### Other Page Components\n\n- **Sidebar** (`data-testid=\"sidebar\"`): Shown only when logged in\n  - Home link: `data-testid=\"sidebar-link-home\"`\n  - My Trips link: `data-testid=\"sidebar-link-my-trips\"`\n  - Hosting link (host only): `data-testid=\"sidebar-link-hosting\"`\n  - Profile link: `data-testid=\"sidebar-link-profile\"`\n  - Logout button: `data-testid=\"sidebar-logout\"`\n\n- **Pagination**: `onPageChange` handler for page navigation\n\n### Key Data Points for Selectors\n\n- Property list is paginated (limit: 12 properties per page)\n- Properties fetch from `/api/properties` endpoint with query parameters\n- Each property has: `id`, `title`, `property_type`, `price_per_night`, `city`, `country`, `main_image`, `avg_rating`, `review_count`"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: afae66da48b4ed605 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 30276\ntool_uses: 10\nduration_ms: 21343</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c9de3f4b-08be-4be3-914c-363c5ef7580e","uuid":"33b2b65d-7880-48ac-9b63-73211825fd92","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Look at the AirbnbClone app's main page to understand what data it displays. Check:\n1. /repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/App.tsx - to find routing\n2. The main/home page component - to understand what data loads\n\nI need to know: what data appears on the main page (property cards?), and what write operation could be tested (e.g., login, booking, review, favorite). Give me specific details about element text/structure I can use in Playwright selectors.","agentId":"afae66da48b4ed605","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have a complete understanding. Let me create a comprehensive report for you.\n\n## AirbnbClone App - Main Page Analysis\n\n### Main Page Data Structure\n\nThe main page (Home component at `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/Home.tsx`) displays the following:\n\n**Data Displayed:**\n- **Property Cards Grid**: A responsive grid of property listings (1-4 columns depending on screen size)\n- **Each Property Card Contains:**\n  - Property image with hover zoom effect\n  - Property type badge (top-left, e.g., \"Apartment\", \"House\", \"Villa\")\n  - Property title\n  - Location (city, country)\n  - Price per night\n  - Star rating with review count (if reviews exist) or \"New\" label (if no reviews)\n  - Favorite button (heart icon that toggles when logged in)\n\n### Page Element Selectors\n\n**Search Bar** (`data-testid=\"search-bar\"`):\n- Location input: `data-testid=\"search-location\"` - placeholder \"Where are you going?\"\n- Check-in date: `data-testid=\"search-checkin\"`\n- Check-out date: `data-testid=\"search-checkout\"`\n- Guests input: `data-testid=\"search-guests\"` - placeholder \"Guests\"\n- Search button: `data-testid=\"search-button\"`\n\n**Category Filter** (`data-testid=\"category-filter\"`):\n- Individual type chips: `data-testid=\"category-chip-{type}\"` where type is one of:\n  - Apartment, House, Cabin, Villa, Condo, Loft, Cottage, Townhouse\n- Example: `data-testid=\"category-chip-Apartment\"`\n\n**Property Grid** (`data-testid=\"property-grid\"`):\n- Grid container with loading state: `data-testid=\"property-grid-loading\"`\n- Empty state: `data-testid=\"property-grid-empty\"`\n\n**Property Cards**:\n- Card container: `data-testid=\"property-card-{propertyId}\"`\n- Property type badge: `data-testid=\"property-type-badge-{propertyId}\"`\n- Property title text (within card)\n- Location text: \"{city}, {country}\"\n- Price text: \"${price} / night\"\n- Rating text: \"{rating.toFixed(1)} ({reviewCount})\" or \"New\"\n\n### Write Operations Available\n\n**Primary Write Operation: Add/Remove Favorite**\n\nThis is the most accessible write operation on the home page without navigation:\n\n**Favorite Button** (`data-testid=\"favorite-button-{propertyId}\"`):\n- Located in top-right corner of each property card image\n- Button class: `rounded-full bg-white/70 hover:bg-white/90 transition-colors`\n- Heart icon changes fill color:\n  - Unfilled (gray text): Not favorited\n  - Filled (primary color): Favorited\n- Requires user to be logged in (FavoriteButton returns null if not authenticated)\n- Dispatches Redux action: `addFavorite()` or `removeFavorite()`\n- Action payload: `{ userId: currentUser.id, propertyId }`\n\n**How to Test Favorite in Playwright:**\n1. User must be logged in (have `currentUser` in auth state)\n2. Find favorite button: `page.getByTestId('favorite-button-{propertyId}')`\n3. Click to toggle favorite state\n4. Verify heart icon class changes between filled/unfilled\n5. Verify Redux state updates `favorites.propertyIds` array\n\n### Other Page Components\n\n- **Sidebar** (`data-testid=\"sidebar\"`): Shown only when logged in\n  - Home link: `data-testid=\"sidebar-link-home\"`\n  - My Trips link: `data-testid=\"sidebar-link-my-trips\"`\n  - Hosting link (host only): `data-testid=\"sidebar-link-hosting\"`\n  - Profile link: `data-testid=\"sidebar-link-profile\"`\n  - Logout button: `data-testid=\"sidebar-logout\"`\n\n- **Pagination**: `onPageChange` handler for page navigation\n\n### Key Data Points for Selectors\n\n- Property list is paginated (limit: 12 properties per page)\n- Properties fetch from `/api/properties` endpoint with query parameters\n- Each property has: `id`, `title`, `property_type`, `price_per_night`, `city`, `country`, `main_image`, `avg_rating`, `review_count`"}],"totalDurationMs":21343,"totalTokens":30276,"totalToolUseCount":10,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2232,"cache_read_input_tokens":26971,"output_tokens":1071,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2232},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
